{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115040/extras/MyLastFriday_03.gif?t=1742407506\" />You play as Howard, a man desperate to escape, but the world around him has twisted into something unrecognizable. His journey takes him through bizarre and disturbing places, crawling with grotesque creatures and strange characters. As he unravels his role in this nightmarish reality, it becomes clear that escaping will be far more difficult than he ever imagined. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115040/extras/MyLastFriday_02.gif?t=1742407506\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Immersive first-person horror with a gripping mystery </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tense puzzle-solving and psychological horror elements </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A deeply atmospheric world filled with disturbing encounters </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face the horrors head-on\u2014sometimes the only way to survive is to fight back</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3115040?t=1742407506","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3115040?t=1742407506","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115040/e5e5a102ef3c78bb374a719c45ae69e7509325b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742407506","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115040/e5e5a102ef3c78bb374a719c45ae69e7509325b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742407506","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing